  (text "HOW TO READ: DETECTOR -> LATCH -> SERIES SWITCH + CROWBAR" 
    (at 13.208 260.35 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.4223999999999999 1.4223999999999999)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "1f3ab26c-00f3-5869-b604-efe9db15b4b3")) 
  (text "1  U302 reference + R301/R302 divider -> U303 OV_OK (nominal trip 5.325 V)." 
    (at 13.208 267.462 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.295 1.295)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "c0959e6e-2273-5f09-864e-106dbe617309")) 
  (text "2  U308/U312 qualify supply/reset; U310 qualifies OV_OK and BUCK_PGOOD." 
    (at 13.208 269.9512 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.295 1.295)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "9deb6501-2453-5006-8eda-aec90d2c5d74")) 
  (text "3  ARM clock sets U304; U309 retains ARM_HISTORY until manual RESET." 
    (at 13.208 272.4404 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.295 1.295)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "8889001d-fee8-59a8-9d8b-6146c8a1d9e8")) 
  (text "4  U305 RUN_GATE -> U301 -> opposed Q301/Q302: raw rail to protected rail." 
    (at 13.208 274.9296 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.295 1.295)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "7aad7e30-eacc-5b0f-9199-e347cb4920a1")) 
  (text "5  Fault clears run latch; U311 CROWBAR_ON -> U315 -> Q303 + ballast to GND." 
    (at 13.208 277.4188 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.295 1.295)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "710a8230-0e85-5152-847c-d68fa4dda3b8")) 
  (text "6  Q304 also asserts INPUT_SHDN. No automatic retry; RESET then ARM." 
    (at 13.208 279.908 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.295 1.295)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "06b44b1d-495c-5f63-b4e4-1e5a2f227232")) 
  (text "OPEN: timing, SOA, stability and fault energy require review and physical tests." 
    (at 13.208 282.3972 0) 
    (effects 
      (font 
        (size 1.295 1.295)) 
      (justify left top)) 
    (uuid "d36eebb1-4a3d-514d-ad80-165104c37ed5")) 
  (text "EVIDENCE: docs/evidence/r2/sheet03/; ERC does not validate electrical safety." 
